BEGIN ~纯正圣骑士~
SUBCOMPONENT ~为塞琳选择替换职业？~
REQUIRE_COMPONENT ~Sirene_BG2.tp2~ ~0~ ~此组件需先安装塞琳模组~
COPY_EXISTING ~c0sire2.cre~ ~override~
WRITE_SHORT 0x246 0x4000
COPY_EXISTING ~c0sire25.cre~ ~override~
WRITE_SHORT 0x246 0x4000

